flowchart TD
    REQ[Incoming request] --> KIND{Which credential}
    KIND -->|Bearer pyvar_ key| KEY[resolve_api_key in api/middleware/api_keys.py]
    KIND -->|Bearer session JWT, no aud| JWT[decode_token_payload in api/middleware/auth.py]
    KIND -->|Bearer admin token, aud pyvar-admin| ADM[AdminPayload for /internal/admin routes]
    KIND -->|query token on WS /var/stream| STR[decode_stream_payload]
    KIND -->|Bearer trial ticket, aud pyvar-trial| TRI[trial routes only]
    KEY --> TP[TokenPayload, tier read from the database]
    JWT --> TP2[TokenPayload, tier read from the claim]
    TP --> OK[get_current_user routes]
    TP2 --> OK
    STR --> ST1[stream token aud pyvar-stream for one task, or a session JWT]
    TRI --> TL[api/routes/trial.py with its own Redis limits]
    JWT -. aud present .-> REF[refused by decode_token_payload]
    STR -. API key sent .-> REF2[not accepted on the WebSocket]
